          "date": "2026-01-27",
          "time": "09:12",
          "text": "## Conditions\n\n- All materials must remain in the restricted folder (/shared/legal/security/middleware-review) and must not be shared outside the legal, security, and executive group until the contract is fully executed.\n- Finance and Operations must complete the contract signing process by 2026‑02‑05; any deviation requires a fresh security and legal review.\n- If any contract term, security score, or go‑live date changes before execution, the draft must be re‑flagged and re‑approved by **Bob Bauer** and **Ivan Choi**.\n- Maintain the confidentiality markers (restricted folder, keep within the team) on all internal communications of this approval.",
